              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आशीर्वाद — āśīrvād — \"a blessing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लग्नानंतर त्यांनी आजीचे आशीर्वाद घेतले. lagnānantar tyānnī ājīce āśīrvād ghetle. After the wedding they took Grandma's blessings."
            },
