              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आशीर्वाद (āśīrvād) देणे, to bless; आशीर्वाद (āśīrvād) घेणे, to seek a blessing."
            }
          ]
        },
