          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आशीर्वाद (āśīrvād) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit āśīrvāda, 'a benediction' (Monier-Williams): āśis, 'a wish, a blessing', and vāda, 'a saying'."
            }
          ]
        },
