              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अक्षता — akṣatā — \"blessing rice\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पाहुण्यांनी नवरा नवरीवर अक्षता टाकल्या. pāhuṇyānnī navrā navrīvar akṣatā ṭākalyā. The guests showered blessing rice over the bride and groom."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine plural: whole grains of rice, coloured with turmeric or kumkum, showered on a couple as a blessing or offered in worship."
            }
          ]
        },
